---
title: "Corpus — Tier 3 app chrome"
type: app
---

::app-shell[layout=sidebar]

::sidebar[position=left collapsible=true width=240]
::nav-tree[source=files on-select=open_file]
::
::

::toolbar
- button[label="Run" action=run icon=play style=primary]
- separator
- badge[value="Live" color=green]
::

::tab-bar[active=preview]
- preview "Preview"
- edit "Edit"
::

::tab-content[tab=preview]
Preview pane content.
::

::tab-content[tab=edit]
::code-editor[lang=surf source=doc line-numbers=true]
# Editable doc
::
::

::panel[position=bottom height=160 desktop-only=true]
::problem-list[source=diagnostics]
::
::

::

::drawer[name=filters position=right width=320 trigger="Filters"]
Drawer body content.
::

::modal[name=confirm title="Confirm shipment"]
Are you sure you want to ship?
::

::command-palette[trigger=cmd+k]
- "Deploy" description="Ship to production" action=deploy icon=paperplane group=Ops
- "Toggle theme" action=theme icon=moon group=View
::

::badge[value=3 color=red]
::

::suggestion-chips[source=ai.suggestions max=3 dismissible=true]
::

::chat-thread[source=chat.thread on-action=run_action]
::

::chat-input-simple[placeholder="Ask Mako…" action=send]
::

::progress[source=deploy.progress]
- Parse ✓
- Build ●
- Ship ○
::

::log-stream[source=build.log tail=100]
::

::terminal[shell=zsh cwd=~/code]
::

::block-editor[source=doc]
::
